* The file 'nginx' is the logrotate config file. Default is daily backups and keeps for 6 months.
* To test, ./docker-bash nginx, then logrotate -v /etc/logrotate.d/nginx
* Logrotate will reload logging (not kill nginx proc) - kill -USR1 `cat /var/run/nginx.pid`
* Log files are mounted in /xnat-data/xnat/nginx_logs
